  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In an April 16, 2026 official statement, Bradley D. Hansell described investing in Combat Support Agencies as part of a \"no fail\" mission to adopt AI and leverage intelligence data to scale against threats. A supplied reported statement attributed to Hansell, without a date in the evidence, says \"we will not be able to operate at the speed and scale necessary for the future fight.\"",
